# nredf: your machine-local nu interactive-config overrides (aliases,
# keybindings, prompt tweaks, ...).
#
# Sourced at the end of config.nu. chezmoi seeded this file once, empty, and
# will never overwrite it again (the `create_` attribute) — edit it freely.
# See env.local.nu's comment for why this two-file pair is nu's local-
# override point instead of bash/zsh/fish's fuller cascade.
